  (text "F1 + D1: if the supply is connected backwards, D1 conducts and blows F1.\nU1: the ESP32-C3 Wi-Fi peaks take the 5 V load to about 0.5 A. Use a pin-compatible switching\nregulator (e.g. R-78E5.0-1.0) or a 5 V buck module wired to IN / GND / OUT. An L7805 needs a heatsink." (at 20.32 72.39 0)
