  (text "INTERFERENCE AND RELIABILITY MEASURES" (at 279.4 177.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c0369b3f-ef34-5606-a36d-836f8389672d)
  )
  (text "1. D2 flyback diode right at the valve terminals (stripe to +).\n2. Valve current has its own pair (J2) back to J1: star ground at J1.\n3. Decoupling: C1 + C2 on 12 V, C3 + C4 at U1, C10 at J3, C11 at the Nano, C6 at J4.\n4. Flow input: R1 10k pull-up, R2 1k + C5 10nF filter, firmware glitch filter.\n5. Button: R3 10k + C7 100nF. Remote: R7-R10 1k series, R13-R16 100k pull-downs,\n   receiver supply filtered by R17 + C8 + C9. Firmware debounces both.\n6. F1 fuse + D1 crowbar protect against shorts and a reversed supply.\n7. R11 / R12 divide the 5 V data line down to 3.2 V for the ESP.\n8. Twist the flow sensor signal with its GND; route it away from the valve wires.\n9. Ground plane on the bottom layer; short, wide 12 V tracks; antenna away from relay and J2." (at 279.4 181.61 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid de328534-c60d-586d-b9b9-d07179141da1)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
